OL,3,GNEWSAMotorists warned of 'disruptive'
OL,4,Amotorway closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists using the M4/M5 Almondsbury
OL,7,FInterchange are advised to plan their
OL,8,Fjourneys ahead as months of repair work
OL,9,Fbegins later.
OL,11,FNational Highways said the road would
OL,12,Fbe fully closed from the M4 junction 20
OL,13,Fwestbound to the M5 junction 15
OL,14,Fnorthbound from 22:00 BST until 06:00
OL,15,Fon 6 December.
OL,17,FThe agency said the closure was
OL,18,Fnecessary to carry out work on
OL,19,Flighting, camera installation, concrete
OL,20,Frepairs, waterproofing, the safety
OL,21,Fbarrier, bridge joints, resurfacing,
OL,22,Fdrainage, road markings and studs.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
