OL,3,GNEWSAMotorists warned of 'disruptive'
OL,4,Amotorway closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are advised to allow extra
OL,7,Ftime to follow signposted diversions
OL,8,Fand National Highways acknowledged that
OL,9,Fthe work would be "disruptive".
